# Do it right

Read the `do-it-right` skill. Do not implement the first idea because the user said yes.

## House stops

- Re-diagnose. Print Chosen Fix **before** production edits.
- Bandaids auto-rejected. Sibling issues found in the hunt are not silent follow-ups.
- Edits unstaged. No commit/push/PR unless asked.
